    "summary": "Bearer: an **INQUISITOR** model.\n\n**Aura (6\")**: whenever an enemy unit up to 6\" from the bearer is picked to make a **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, it must take a [Leadership test](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls) first. If it fails, it has to [Remain Stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary) for the rest of the phase instead.",
